{"id":"n14438-3-5","stage":3,"title":"뱉다 · 说出来","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14438-3-5-1","ko":"내가 말실수를 해서 지수가 화가 난 것 같아.","zh":"我好像说错了话，把智秀惹生气了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"말실수를","meaning":"失言，说错话","explanation":"말실수：失言，说错话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말실수","audio":"/audio/f5b406408a8e489568c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51735","senseId":"1","lemma":"말실수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말실수를","audio":"/audio/82b7f280306c3db8f345.mp3"}},{"text":"해서","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"하다：因为，由于；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"18","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서","audio":"/audio/91cbeb2e0a1193dc2da9.mp3"}},{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"화가","meaning":"火，气","explanation":"화：火，气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"화","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74134","senseId":"1","lemma":"화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화가","audio":"/audio/b04487b70213c84b3d2d.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"发火（화이/가 나다）","explanation":"나다：发火（화이/가 나다）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"12","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f5b406408a8e4895","term":"말실수","zh":"失言，说错话","audio":"/audio/f5b406408a8e489568c7.mp3","entryId":"51735","definition":"因说话失当而犯下的失误；或指那些话。","pronunciation":["말ː실쑤"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"因为，由于","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示原因。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"950afe85bf406364","term":"화","zh":"火，气","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3","entryId":"74134","definition":"十分不满意或恼怒的情绪。","pronunciation":["화ː"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发火（화이/가 나다）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"发火（화이/가 나다）","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3067d6604487854fdf92.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14438-3-5-2","ko":"그러게 아무 말이나 뱉으면 어떡하냐.","zh":"就是啊，随便乱说话的话要怎么办呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게","meaning":"那样子","explanation":"그러다：那样子；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}},{"text":"아무","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}},{"text":"말이나","meaning":"语言，话","explanation":"말：语言，话；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"3","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이나","audio":"/audio/197c2111073f54f5627a.mp3"}},{"text":"뱉으면","meaning":"说出来，爆出","explanation":"뱉다：说出来，爆出；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"뱉다","audio":"/audio/a6b6f5321ee30935c00d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14438","senseId":"3","lemma":"뱉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뱉으면","audio":"/audio/43acaee3edac7c256e75.mp3"}},{"text":"어떡하냐.","meaning":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어떡하다：“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"어떡하다","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70480","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떡하냐","audio":"/audio/5885cfad27815e38a18c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样子","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"像前面发生过的事或说过的话一样地做。","pronunciation":["그러다"]},{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definition":"用于指不特定的某人或某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"语言，话","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的声音和文字。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"a6b6f5321ee30935","term":"뱉다","zh":"说出来，爆出","audio":"/audio/a6b6f5321ee30935c00d.mp3","entryId":"14438","definition":"(喻义)乱说话。","pronunciation":["밷ː따"]},{"id":"e39300a264725a21","term":"어떡하다","zh":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3","entryId":"70480","definition":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/b084db5d7305fa43e34d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.995,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14438","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.7203,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["就是啊，随便乱说话的话要怎么办呢？","我好像说错了话，把智秀惹生气了。","有自己房间了，开心吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我好像说错了话，把智秀惹生气了。","有自己房间了，开心吗？","就是啊，随便乱说话的话要怎么办呢？"],"answer":2}]}
